@startuml

footbox off
title Sequence Diagram - US008 Register a new city in the System

actor Administrator
participant ":UI" as UI
participant ":US008_toRegisterACityCtrl" as CityController
participant ":CountryRepository" as CountryRepository
participant ":CityRepository" as CityRepository
participant ":CityFactory" as CityFactory

Administrator -> UI : **1** I want to register a new city
activate UI

UI --> Administrator : **2** From which country is the city?
deactivate UI

Administrator -> UI : **3** The city is from the country <countryName>
activate UI

UI -> CityController : **4** getCountryName(countryName)
activate CityController

CityController -> CountryRepository : **5** exists(countryName)
activate CountryRepository
CountryRepository -> CountryRepository : **6** validate(countryName)
CountryRepository --> CityController : **7** true
deactivate CountryRepository

CityController --> UI : **8** country exists
deactivate CityController

UI --> Administrator : **9** What is the name of the city?
deactivate UI

Administrator -> UI : **10** The city's name is <cityName>
activate UI

UI -> CityController : **11** registerNewCity(cityName, countryName)
activate CityController

CityController -> CityRepository : **12** createAndAdd(cityName, countryName)
activate CityRepository

CityRepository -> CityFactory : **13** create(cityName, countryName)
activate CityFactory

create "newCity : City" as City
CityFactory -> City : **14** create(cityName, countryName)

CityFactory --> CityRepository : **15** newCity
deactivate CityFactory

CityRepository -> CityRepository : **16** validate(newCity)
CityRepository -> CityRepository : **17** add(newCity)

CityRepository --> CityController : **18** success(newCity)
deactivate CityRepository

CityController --> UI : **19** success(newCity)
deactivate CityController

UI --> Administrator : **20** <newCity> has been registered successfully!
deactivate UI

@enduml